#ASSERT `Where does my request for reasons stand question` (`on` 2 3 2026) TRUE (`on` 31 3 2026) (`on` 1 4 2026) EQUALS `late: no answer within 28 days; I may apply to the Tribunal for a decision whether reasons should be given (s 270(1)(b), (2))`
#ASSERT `Where does my request for reasons stand question` (`on` 2 3 2026) FALSE (`on` 2 3 2026) (`on` 30 3 2026) EQUALS `not yet due: the decision-maker has until the 28th day after receiving my request`
#ASSERT `Where does my request for reasons stand question` (`on` 2 3 2026) FALSE (`on` 2 3 2026) (`on` 31 3 2026) EQUALS `late: no answer within 28 days; I may apply to the Tribunal for a decision whether reasons should be given (s 270(1)(b), (2))`

